        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: University of Washington, Texas Christian University\n- Places: Seattle, Washington; Fort Worth, Texas\n- People: Addison Clark, Randolph Clark\n- Concepts: public flagship research university, private coeducational university\n\nFacts:\n- The University of Washington is a large public flagship research university in Seattle, Washington, and it was established in 1861.\n- The University of Washington is commonly referred to as UW, Washington, or informally as U-Dub.\n- Texas Christian University is a private coeducational university in Fort Worth, Texas, and it was established in 1873.\n- Addison Clark and Randolph Clark founded Texas Christian University in 1873 as AddRan Male & Female College.",
